2:5	compose:naming-check	manual	Composable functions that return Unit should start with an uppercase letter.\nThey are considered declarative entities that can be either present or absent in a composition and therefore follow the naming rules for classes.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#naming-composable-functions-properly for more information.
